1,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Büyük Korsan Çağı'nda...Dialogue: 55,0:00:04.11,0:00:09.07,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,...Dünya Hükûmeti'nin beklentilerini aşan bir yankı uyanıyordu.Dialogue: 55,0:00:10.91,0:00:18.12,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Engel tanımayan dalgaların göbeğinde tüm gözleri üzerine çekenler ise...Dialogue: 55,0:00:20.00,0:00:21.83,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,...Monkey D. Luffy'yle...Dialogue: 55,0:00:23.13,0:00:25.13,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,...Hasır Şapkalar'dı!Dialogue: 55,0:00:27.51,0:00:31.39,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Çalkantılı Büyük Korsan Çağı'yla başa çıkma amacıyla da...Dialogue: 55,0:00:31.39,0:00:35.85,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,...50 devlet lideri, dört yılda bir  Dünya Zirvesi düzenlemekteydi.Dialogue: 55,0:00:36.72,0:00:39.94,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Reverie olarak bilinen zirve gelip çatmıştı.Dialogue: 55,0:00:44.69,0:00:48.32,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Çağ, ciddi bir değişime maruz kalmaktadır.Dialogue: 55,0:00:57.00,0:00:58.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Karnım zil çalıyor!Dialogue: 55,0:01:02.33,0:01:03.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu da ne?Dialogue: 55,0:01:05.55,0:01:07.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nereden buldun?Dialogue: 55,0:01:07.21,0:01:09.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha? Cebimden düştü.Dialogue: 55,0:01:09.80,0:01:11.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Süper ya! Gerçek mi peki?Dialogue: 55,0:01:11.80,0:01:13.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neyi diyorsun?Dialogue: 55,0:01:13.05,0:01:14.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hatırlamıyor musun?Dialogue: 55,0:01:15.14,0:01:18.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Germa bununla dönüşüm geçirirdi.Dialogue: 55,0:01:18.27,0:01:19.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sahi! Şimdi hatırladım!Dialogue: 55,0:01:19.98,0:01:22.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de dönüşüm geçireceğim!Dialogue: 55,0:01:22.40,0:01:24.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ağır ol! İlk ben!Dialogue: 55,0:01:25.61,0:01:27.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sanji! – Sanji!Dialogue: 55,0:01:27.32,0:01:29.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu çöpten kurtulayım.Dialogue: 55,0:01:29.69,0:01:30.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ne?! – Ne?!Dialogue: 55,0:01:30.99,0:01:32.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sakın atayım deme!Dialogue: 55,0:01:32.82,0:01:35.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Atarsan da denizin dibine kadar ararım bak!Dialogue: 55,0:01:35.70,0:01:38.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nah ararsın! Yüzemiyorsun bile!Dialogue: 55,0:01:38.49,0:01:42.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim cebimden çıktı, atacaksan bana ver bari!Dialogue: 55,0:01:42.54,0:01:44.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, bana ver lütfen! N'olur!Dialogue: 55,0:01:44.96,0:01:45.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olmaz!Dialogue: 55,0:01:47.21,0:01:51.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O değil de nasıl Luffy-san'ın cebine girdi ki?Dialogue: 55,0:01:52.09,0:01:53.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Niji'nin işidir!Dialogue: 55,0:01:53.59,0:01:55.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kafam atsın diye yapmıştır.Dialogue: 55,0:01:58.14,0:02:03.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle bir bilimsel zamazingo vasıtasıyla güçlenmek istemiyorum!Dialogue: 55,0:02:03.19,0:02:04.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peşin hüküm verme, Sanji!Dialogue: 55,0:02:04.90,0:02:07.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bilim de insanların en büyük meziyetlerindendir!Dialogue: 55,0:02:07.77,0:02:09.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Niye üzerine bu kadar düşüyorsunuz ki?Dialogue: 55,0:02:09.82,0:02:13.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Raid suit'i giyersek... – Raid suit'i giyersek...Dialogue: 55,0:02:09.82,0:02:13.03,Note-207+,,0,0,0,,Raid Suit: Baskın KıyafetDialogue: 55,0:02:18.70,0:02:21.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– ...biz de ışın atabiliriz! – ...biz de ışın atabiliriz!Dialogue: 55,0:02:21.00,0:02:22.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çocuk musunuz be?!Dialogue: 55,0:02:22.75,0:02:24.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky bunu zaten yapıyor!Dialogue: 55,0:02:24.62,0:02:26.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ekibimizde yeterince ucube var.Dialogue: 55,0:02:26.96,0:02:28.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır! Ben istiyorum!Dialogue: 55,0:02:28.00,0:02:31.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doğru mu duydum? Bilimi mi kötülüyorsun?Dialogue: 55,0:02:31.26,0:02:33.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-swan !Dialogue: 55,0:02:33.13,0:02:36.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiç öyle yapar mıyım canım ya?Dialogue: 55,0:02:36.26,0:02:42.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Büyülü İklim Aygıtı'm da hava bilimiyle Usopp'un teknolojisinin ürünüdür!Dialogue: 55,0:02:43.14,0:02:43.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bak!Dialogue: 55,0:02:48.40,0:02:50.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu aygıtın içi süper abi ya!Dialogue: 55,0:02:50.94,0:02:52.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus?!Dialogue: 55,0:02:52.28,0:02:54.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Harbiden bizimle geldin ha!Dialogue: 55,0:02:54.03,0:02:56.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boğaz derdine Big Mom'a olan sadakatinden vazgeçtiğine inanamıyorum!Dialogue: 55,0:02:56.86,0:02:59.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ Kendime güçlü bir köle buldum! ♪Dialogue: 55,0:02:59.28,0:03:00.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-Nami-san...Dialogue: 55,0:03:01.91,0:03:03.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus, şunu kafana kazı...Dialogue: 55,0:03:04.58,0:03:08.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-san'ın bir numaralı kölesi benim!Dialogue: 55,0:03:08.50,0:03:13.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi de yanından hiç ayırmadığı aygıtının içinde yaşıyorum ben!Dialogue: 55,0:03:13.51,0:03:15.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lan?!Dialogue: 55,0:03:15.05,0:03:17.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji-san...  Bir su buharı kütlesini kıskanıyorsun.Dialogue: 55,0:03:17.89,0:03:20.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi bakalım! İş başına!Dialogue: 55,0:03:21.56,0:03:23.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Neden olmuyor ki? – Neden olmuyor ki?Dialogue: 55,0:03:23.81,0:03:24.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zırlamayı kesin be!Dialogue: 55,0:03:24.56,0:03:27.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yalnızca senin elinden oluyor galiba!Dialogue: 55,0:03:27.44,0:03:29.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizim için yapsana!Dialogue: 55,0:03:29.27,0:03:30.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesin!Dialogue: 55,0:03:30.19,0:03:32.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben bir Germa değilim!Dialogue: 55,0:03:32.19,0:03:35.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Açın kulaklarınızı!  "Germa 66"! "Vinsmoke"!Dialogue: 55,0:03:36.09,0:03:38.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir daha karşımda bu isimleri ağzınıza almayın!Dialogue: 55,0:03:38.66,0:03:40.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Teşekkürler!Dialogue: 55,0:03:41.41,0:03:44.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dönüş lütfen!Dialogue: 55,0:03:42.74,0:03:44.50,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Bıraksanıza şapşallar!Dialogue: 55,0:03:44.50,0:03:45.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Millet!Dialogue: 55,0:03:45.75,0:03:47.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gazete geldi!Dialogue: 55,0:03:47.83,0:03:50.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizim hakkımızda yazmışlar mı?Dialogue: 55,0:03:50.00,0:03:51.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bakayım...Dialogue: 55,0:03:52.46,0:03:53.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy'nin yakın çekim fotoğrafı var!Dialogue: 55,0:03:54.59,0:03:55.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peki ya Jinbe?Dialogue: 55,0:03:55.92,0:03:58.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biz ayrıldıktan sonra neler olduğunu yazmışlar mı?Dialogue: 55,0:03:59.05,0:04:02.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bakayım... Jinbe, Jinbe...Dialogue: 55,0:04:02.05,0:04:04.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonrası yazmıyor gibi.Dialogue: 55,0:04:04.27,0:04:09.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Sanji, Jinbe ve Bege'nin birlikte Big Mom'a suikast düzenlediği yazıyor.Dialogue: 55,0:04:09.52,0:04:11.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elebaşının da Luffy olduğunu yazmışlar!Dialogue: 55,0:04:11.77,0:04:12.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elebaşı mı?Dialogue: 55,0:04:14.40,0:04:15.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aranan posteri düştü!Dialogue: 55,0:04:17.65,0:04:19.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kelle ödülüm yükselmiş.Dialogue: 55,0:04:19.03,0:04:21.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,330 milyon beliye çıkmış!Dialogue: 55,0:04:21.37,0:04:22.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cidden mi lan?Dialogue: 55,0:04:22.95,0:04:25.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dur biraz, Yosun Kafa'nın kelle ödülü ne kadardı?Dialogue: 55,0:04:25.20,0:04:27.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yanılmıyorsam Zoro-san'ın kelle ödülü...Dialogue: 55,0:04:27.21,0:04:29.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...320 milyon beliydi!Dialogue: 55,0:04:29.54,0:04:31.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşte bu!Dialogue: 55,0:04:31.71,0:04:33.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geçtim lan seni, Yosun Kafa!Dialogue: 55,0:04:33.80,0:04:35.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alt tarafı bir sayı yahu.Dialogue: 55,0:04:35.92,0:04:40.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Yalnızca Diri" şartını da "Ölü ya da Diri" yapmışlar!Dialogue: 55,0:04:43.35,0:04:46.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha? Ne oldu ki?Dialogue: 55,0:04:46.14,0:04:47.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adım...Dialogue: 55,0:04:51.44,0:04:53.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Vinsmoke Sanji" yazıyor!Dialogue: 55,0:04:53.94,0:04:55.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi anladım,...Dialogue: 55,0:04:55.53,0:04:59.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Germa'nın kötü şöhreti yüzünden ödül yükselmiş!Dialogue: 55,0:04:59.61,0:05:02.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Sanji-san! İyi misin?Dialogue: 55,0:05:02.32,0:05:06.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha, bir yıkık daha!Dialogue: 55,0:05:08.25,0:05:09.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,L-Luffy!Dialogue: 55,0:05:09.66,0:05:11.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne oldu?Dialogue: 55,0:05:15.46,0:05:17.63,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu esnada...Dialogue: 55,0:05:19.05,0:05:23.59,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,...herkesin dilinde dört yılda bir Kutsal Toprak Mariejois'te...Dialogue: 55,0:05:23.59,0:05:28.85,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,...dünya liderlerinin zirvesi Reverie vardı.Dialogue: 55,0:05:30.14,0:05:34.65,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu anda ise deniz seviyesinin 10 bin metre aşağısındaki Balık Adam Adası...Dialogue: 55,0:05:34.65,0:05:37.61,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,...Ryugu Krallığı'ndayız.Dialogue: 55,0:05:37.61,0:05:39.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Katılmış-jamon!Dialogue: 55,0:05:39.82,0:05:43.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jinbe nihayet Luffy-kun'un tayfasına katılmış!Dialogue: 55,0:05:45.07,0:05:49.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama birlikte Big Mom'a kafa tuttuklarına inanamıyorum!Dialogue: 55,0:05:49.54,0:05:52.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aynı gemiyle mi kaçtılar acaba?Dialogue: 55,0:05:52.42,0:05:55.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jinbe ile Hasır Şapka yani-fa-so-la-ti-do! ♪Dialogue: 55,0:05:55.71,0:06:00.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyle olmuştur,  Big Mom'ın küplere bindiği yazıyor.Dialogue: 55,0:06:01.42,0:06:07.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyleyse ülkemizin güvenliği de Hasır Şapkalar'dan sorulur artık-jamon!Dialogue: 55,0:06:07.22,0:06:09.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baba-sama! Abi-sama!Dialogue: 55,0:06:12.48,0:06:14.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi.Dialogue: 55,0:06:15.19,0:06:17.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de Reverie'ye sizinle geliyorum!Dialogue: 55,0:06:17.90,0:06:22.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoksa Luffy-sama bana yine Korkakhoshi der!Dialogue: 55,0:06:26.78,0:06:29.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de bunu duymayı bekliyordum!Dialogue: 55,0:06:29.33,0:06:31.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Güzel, bizimle geliyorsun!Dialogue: 55,0:06:32.12,0:06:33.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peki!Dialogue: 55,0:06:35.88,0:06:42.92,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Gelgelelim genç korsan Luffy'nin onlarca yıldır hüküm süren, Yonko...Dialogue: 55,0:06:42.92,0:06:48.14,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,...Big Mom'a diş göstermesinin yankısı yaklaşan kurultayı bile...Dialogue: 55,0:06:48.14,0:06:50.77,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,...gölgede bırakmıştı.Dialogue: 55,0:06:51.64,0:06:53.60,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Gazeteler şöyle yazıyordu:Dialogue: 55,0:06:54.31,0:06:57.98,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,"Bir kaynaktan elde edilen bilgiye göre  Hasır Şapka Luffy çoktan...Dialogue: 55,0:06:57.98,0:07:01.57,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,...yedi güçlü korsan tayfasını boyunduruğuna sokarak...Dialogue: 55,0:07:01.57,0:07:06.82,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,...sayısı 5 bini aşan mürettebatıyla büyük bir korsan olmuştur."Dialogue: 55,0:07:07.78,0:07:11.33,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace'in yanı sıra Devrim Ordusu'nun iki numarası Sabo'yla...Dialogue: 55,0:07:11.33,0:07:13.96,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,...kan kardeş olması sükse yapıyordu.Dialogue: 55,0:07:14.96,0:07:20.80,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Şeytani ordu Germa 66'ya, Güneş Korsanları'na ve Ateş Tankı Korsanları'na...Dialogue: 55,0:07:20.80,0:07:25.42,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,...nadir rastlanır bir karizma ve önderlikle boyun eğdirdi.Dialogue: 55,0:07:26.01,0:07:30.97,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Son derece ince düşünülmüş bir stratejiyle kraliçenin şatosunu tuzla buz edecek bir zekâ!Dialogue: 55,0:07:32.14,0:07:36.06,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,800 milyon ve 1 milyarlık kelle ödülüne sahip üst kademe mürettebatı alt edecek bir kudret!Dialogue: 55,0:07:37.02,0:07:41.07,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka Luffy'nin bu savaştan muzaffer ayrıldığını söylemek işten bile değil!Dialogue: 55,0:07:41.86,0:07:45.03,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Gazetedeki yazı ise şu şekilde noktalanmıştı:Dialogue: 55,0:07:45.99,0:07:49.87,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,"Denizin Beşinci İmparatoru doğmuştur!"Dialogue: 55,0:07:53.24,0:07:56.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu "Beşinci İmparator" saçmalığı da neyin nesi?!Dialogue: 55,0:07:56.50,0:08:02.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aşağılık korsan müsveddeleri Yonko veya Gokou diye tuttursun dursunlar!Dialogue: 55,0:07:56.50,0:08:02.17,Note-207+,,0,0,0,,(Yonko: Dört İmparator, Gokou: Beş İmparator)Dialogue: 55,0:08:05.63,0:08:08.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rapor veriyorum, Filo Amirali Sakazuki!Dialogue: 55,0:08:08.76,0:08:13.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Lulusia Krallığı'nın gemisi  korsanların saldırısına uğradı!Dialogue: 55,0:08:14.02,0:08:18.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Krala bir şey olmamış olsa da Prenses Comane kaçırıldı...Dialogue: 55,0:08:18.31,0:08:20.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korumalar ne halta yarıyor?Dialogue: 55,0:08:25.78,0:08:26.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şah.Dialogue: 55,0:08:30.03,0:08:32.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Büyükbaba! Büyükbaba!Dialogue: 55,0:08:33.33,0:08:34.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne oldu Rebecca?Dialogue: 55,0:08:34.79,0:08:35.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baksana!Dialogue: 55,0:08:36.08,0:08:38.33,Main-207+,,0,0,2,,Lucy hakkındaki haberi okudun mu?Dialogue: 55,0:08:38.33,0:08:40.17,Main-207+,,0,0,2,,Evet, okudum.Dialogue: 55,0:08:40.17,0:08:41.33,Main-207+,,0,0,2,,Hadi ya...Dialogue: 55,0:08:41.33,0:08:43.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffyland muhteşem-resu!Dialogue: 55,0:08:43.71,0:08:46.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Patronumuza da bu yakışırdı!Dialogue: 55,0:08:46.30,0:08:50.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biz de gazeteye çıkmışız.Dialogue: 55,0:08:51.39,0:08:56.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizler, Kutsal Topraklar'a girince bunlardan sakın bahsetmeyin.Dialogue: 55,0:08:56.27,0:08:58.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne? Niye ki-resu?Dialogue: 55,0:08:58.35,0:09:01.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendisine büyük vefa borcumuz olsa da...Dialogue: 55,0:09:01.73,0:09:05.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Dünya Hükûmeti'yle Donanma'nın bakış açısı farklı.Dialogue: 55,0:09:06.15,0:09:08.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doğru diyorsun! O bir korsan!Dialogue: 55,0:09:08.53,0:09:13.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsan olmasının yanı sıra şu an son derece tehlikeli biri olarak görülüyor.Dialogue: 55,0:09:13.70,0:09:15.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cidden muhteşem ya!Dialogue: 55,0:09:15.20,0:09:17.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sahi! Viola-san'a da göstereyim!Dialogue: 55,0:09:18.16,0:09:19.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi gösterelim!Dialogue: 55,0:09:23.42,0:09:28.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adım gibi eminim. Bunlar Dressrosa ile Prodence Krallığı'nın gemileri!Dialogue: 55,0:09:28.30,0:09:30.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yanlarında Donanma koruması da yok!Dialogue: 55,0:09:30.67,0:09:34.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lan! P- Prenses Viola'yı gördüm!Dialogue: 55,0:09:34.01,0:09:36.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dedikleri kadar varmış be.Dialogue: 55,0:09:36.43,0:09:38.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yanındaki kız da kraliyet ailesinden mi ki?Dialogue: 55,0:09:38.85,0:09:42.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İkisini kaçırırsak ne kadar fidye koparırız acaba?Dialogue: 55,0:09:43.85,0:09:46.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen ne diyorsun, Prenses Comane?Dialogue: 55,0:09:47.11,0:09:49.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hemen babamı arayın işte!Dialogue: 55,0:09:49.65,0:09:52.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İstediğiniz fidyeyi öder!Dialogue: 55,0:09:54.07,0:09:56.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu yüzden kraliyet ailelerine bayılıyorum ya!Dialogue: 55,0:09:56.33,0:10:00.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Az daha sabredeceksin ama bir fidye bizi kesmez.Dialogue: 55,0:10:00.12,0:10:04.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizi de fark edemezler. Neticede...Dialogue: 55,0:10:04.67,0:10:07.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...suyun altındayız!Dialogue: 55,0:10:07.63,0:10:08.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Batırın gemilerini!Dialogue: 55,0:10:08.80,0:10:09.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baş üstüne!Dialogue: 55,0:10:11.59,0:10:15.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Torpido saldırısından kaçınmaları mümkün değil!Dialogue: 55,0:10:36.57,0:10:37.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne oldu öyle?Dialogue: 55,0:10:38.28,0:10:39.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Düşman saldırısı mı?Dialogue: 55,0:10:40.16,0:10:41.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Topları hazırlayın!Dialogue: 55,0:10:41.45,0:10:42.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Emredersiniz! – Emredersiniz!Dialogue: 55,0:10:44.08,0:10:45.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerek yok! İçiniz rahat olsun!Dialogue: 55,0:10:50.30,0:10:51.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yetişebildiğime sevindim.Dialogue: 55,0:10:51.92,0:10:53.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık güvendesiniz!Dialogue: 55,0:10:53.59,0:10:55.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Denizci misin?Dialogue: 55,0:10:56.97,0:10:59.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Donanma Karargâhı Albayı, Koby'yim!Dialogue: 55,0:11:00.56,0:11:02.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iskaladık mı lan?Dialogue: 55,0:11:02.10,0:11:03.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mümkün değil!Dialogue: 55,0:11:06.90,0:11:10.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Su alıyoruz!Dialogue: 55,0:11:10.40,0:11:12.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaralanmadınız ya?Dialogue: 55,0:11:14.90,0:11:17.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dressrosa ile Prodence'in iştirakçilerisiniz, değil mi?Dialogue: 55,0:11:17.99,0:11:19.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yolculuk sizi yormuş olmalı.Dialogue: 55,0:11:19.99,0:11:22.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demin ne oldu?Dialogue: 55,0:11:22.37,0:11:24.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nereden geldin?Dialogue: 55,0:11:27.54,0:11:30.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uzaktaki bir Donanma gemisinden atlayıp geldim.Dialogue: 55,0:11:31.67,0:11:36.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geminiz az önce su altından korsanların saldırısına maruz kaldı.Dialogue: 55,0:11:36.13,0:11:37.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Su altından demek...Dialogue: 55,0:11:37.89,0:11:39.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Torpido mu attılar?Dialogue: 55,0:11:39.60,0:11:41.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neyse ki ıskalamışlar ya!Dialogue: 55,0:11:41.64,0:11:42.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet.Dialogue: 55,0:11:44.48,0:11:46.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Helmeppo-san, orada vaziyet nedir?Dialogue: 55,0:11:46.85,0:11:48.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanları yakaladık!Dialogue: 55,0:11:53.48,0:11:54.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bakın!Dialogue: 55,0:11:55.07,0:11:57.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lulusialı Prenses Comane de güvende!Dialogue: 55,0:11:57.82,0:11:59.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pis herifler!Dialogue: 55,0:11:59.24,0:12:01.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepsini şişe geçirip pişirin!Dialogue: 55,0:12:01.37,0:12:02.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adileri affetmeyeceğim!Dialogue: 55,0:12:02.99,0:12:05.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şüpheniz olmasın,  en ağır cezayı alacaklar, prenses!Dialogue: 55,0:12:05.70,0:12:10.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O değil de Gözlem Haki'ne ne olmuş öyle Koby?Dialogue: 55,0:12:10.71,0:12:14.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Torpido falan hissetmedim ben.Dialogue: 55,0:12:16.55,0:12:17.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir denizaltı...?Dialogue: 55,0:12:17.88,0:12:22.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zamane korsanlarına karşı tedbiri elden bırakmaya gelmiyor, ucuz atlattık.Dialogue: 55,0:12:22.26,0:12:23.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baksana.Dialogue: 55,0:12:25.06,0:12:27.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meşhur Albay Koby sensin demek!Dialogue: 55,0:12:27.56,0:12:28.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 55,0:12:28.69,0:12:30.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rocky Port* hadisesindeki kişi mi?Dialogue: 55,0:12:30.98,0:12:37.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arkasında En Kötü Nesil'den Trafalgar Law'un olduğu hadisede...Dialogue: 55,0:12:37.19,0:12:40.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vatandaşları koruyan kahramansın.Dialogue: 55,0:12:42.32,0:12:45.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N- Ne kahramanı canım, yapmayın lütfen!Dialogue: 55,0:12:45.20,0:12:48.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gözü pek bir eski toprak olduğunu sanarken yardımsever bir delikanlı çıktın!Dialogue: 55,0:12:48.41,0:12:51.29,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Vay... Bu adam epey sağlam.Dialogue: 55,0:12:51.63,0:12:55.50,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Torpidoyu durduğunu dahi dile getirmedi.Dialogue: 55,0:12:55.50,0:12:56.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Teşekkürler!Dialogue: 55,0:12:56.92,0:12:58.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne demek...Dialogue: 55,0:12:58.55,0:13:00.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha, Luffy-san!Dialogue: 55,0:13:00.55,0:13:03.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka Luffy demek istedim!Dialogue: 55,0:13:03.05,0:13:05.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Manşetteki fotoğraf gözüme takıldı da.Dialogue: 55,0:13:05.68,0:13:07.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okumak ister misin Koby-san?Dialogue: 55,0:13:07.14,0:13:10.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne okuyacağım ya? Şey, aslında...Dialogue: 55,0:13:14.69,0:13:16.82,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,"Denizin Beşinci İmparatoru..."Dialogue: 55,0:13:18.11,0:13:21.57,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san her zamanki gibi acayip havalı ya!Dialogue: 55,0:13:22.66,0:13:25.24,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir an bile yerinde saymıyor!Dialogue: 55,0:13:26.24,0:13:27.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koby-san?Dialogue: 55,0:13:32.58,0:13:36.55,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Gazetelere her haber olduğunda gözümde o gün canlanıyor.Dialogue: 55,0:13:40.80,0:13:42.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Albay Koby!Dialogue: 55,0:13:42.09,0:13:44.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapıyorsun? Güverteye dön!Dialogue: 55,0:13:44.30,0:13:45.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hemen!Dialogue: 55,0:13:49.89,0:13:51.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Teşekkür ederim!Dialogue: 55,0:13:52.69,0:13:53.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lafı olmaz.Dialogue: 55,0:13:54.44,0:14:01.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çok yakında Yeni Marineford'a varacağınız için yolun kalanında size eşlik edeceğiz!Dialogue: 55,0:14:02.32,0:14:04.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sağ olun.Dialogue: 55,0:14:05.41,0:14:06.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baksana.Dialogue: 55,0:14:08.08,0:14:09.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne oldu?Dialogue: 55,0:14:09.20,0:14:11.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucy'yi seviyor musun, Koby-kun?Dialogue: 55,0:14:11.33,0:14:13.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffyland'ı seviyorsun, değil mi?Dialogue: 55,0:14:13.21,0:14:15.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yok be! D-Düşmanımız olur bir kere!Dialogue: 55,0:14:15.83,0:14:17.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bak, sen!Dialogue: 55,0:14:17.96,0:14:19.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimseye söylemeyiz ya.Dialogue: 55,0:14:19.51,0:14:21.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biraz laflayalım hadi.Dialogue: 55,0:14:21.26,0:14:25.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Bırakın lütfen! B-Ben bir Denizci'yim!Dialogue: 55,0:14:25.26,0:14:28.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gazeteyi okurken yüzünde güller açıyordu ama!Dialogue: 55,0:14:28.06,0:14:29.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ş-Şeyden dolayı...Dialogue: 55,0:14:29.64,0:14:32.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi ya, biraz konuşalım!Dialogue: 55,0:14:30.89,0:14:32.43,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-Yapmayın lütfen!Dialogue: 55,0:14:32.85,0:14:35.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şuradaki makalede de Luffyland geçiyor!Dialogue: 55,0:14:35.56,0:14:36.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hani?Dialogue: 55,0:14:36.61,0:14:39.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doğru tahmin etmişiz!Dialogue: 55,0:14:46.87,0:14:47.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin...Dialogue: 55,0:14:48.83,0:14:51.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Germa'nın namı sebebiyle yükseldiyse...Dialogue: 55,0:14:52.33,0:14:55.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...neyleyeyim öyle ödülü?Dialogue: 55,0:14:58.29,0:15:00.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baksana, iyi misin?Dialogue: 55,0:15:00.71,0:15:02.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaraların mı sızlıyor?Dialogue: 55,0:15:03.42,0:15:05.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y- Yok ya...Dialogue: 55,0:15:05.80,0:15:07.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu...Dialogue: 55,0:15:09.18,0:15:12.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ödülüm düşmüş ya!Dialogue: 55,0:15:12.98,0:15:14.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baksanıza!Dialogue: 55,0:15:14.10,0:15:16.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,150 milyon beliye düşmüş.Dialogue: 55,0:15:16.06,0:15:17.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ne?! – Ne?!Dialogue: 55,0:15:18.81,0:15:22.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Harbi mi? Daha geçenlerde 500 milyona çıktı sanıyordum!Dialogue: 55,0:15:22.86,0:15:26.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,150 milyon, iki yıl önceki ödülünden de aşağıda ama!Dialogue: 55,0:15:26.99,0:15:29.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle bir şey olabilir mi ki?Dialogue: 55,0:15:29.58,0:15:31.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir halt mı yedin yoksa?Dialogue: 55,0:15:31.87,0:15:33.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyle olsa artmaz mıydı?Dialogue: 55,0:15:33.37,0:15:35.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sahi, orası öyle.Dialogue: 55,0:15:37.88,0:15:40.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi yönünden bakalım ya, herkes peşine düşmez artık.Dialogue: 55,0:15:40.92,0:15:42.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 55,0:15:42.50,0:15:43.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy kaptanımız olur!Dialogue: 55,0:15:43.92,0:15:46.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İtibarımız zedelenebilir!Dialogue: 55,0:15:46.18,0:15:49.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sokarım böyle işe! Neden ama?Dialogue: 55,0:15:51.76,0:15:53.89,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,Bombardımana hazırlanın!Dialogue: 55,0:15:53.89,0:15:56.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ateş!Dialogue: 55,0:16:00.11,0:16:02.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gidelim!Dialogue: 55,0:16:02.61,0:16:05.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soyup soğana çevirelim!Dialogue: 55,0:16:05.82,0:16:07.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Donanma n'apıyor ya?Dialogue: 55,0:16:07.70,0:16:10.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yardıma geldiklerini sanmıştım!Dialogue: 55,0:16:11.66,0:16:13.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne cüretle gemimizi batırırsınız?Dialogue: 55,0:16:15.95,0:16:17.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hay böyle işin!Dialogue: 55,0:16:24.25,0:16:26.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yemişim Donanma'yı!Dialogue: 55,0:16:26.92,0:16:33.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Reverie'ye giden kralları,  maharetli tüm askerlerini de peşine taktı!Dialogue: 55,0:16:33.14,0:16:38.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Savunmasız kalmış bir ülke korsanlar için kolay lokmadır!Dialogue: 55,0:16:39.56,0:16:41.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pür dikkat dinleyin!Dialogue: 55,0:16:43.19,0:16:46.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yonko Karasakal'ın himayesi altında...Dialogue: 55,0:16:46.78,0:16:50.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,..."Pembesakal" adı bahşedilmiş adamım!Dialogue: 55,0:16:50.78,0:16:52.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adımı kafanıza kazıyın!Dialogue: 55,0:16:52.95,0:16:55.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Karasakal'dan korkun!Dialogue: 55,0:16:57.04,0:16:58.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haydi millet!Dialogue: 55,0:16:58.83,0:17:02.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Karasakal'ın adına şehri yağmalayın!Dialogue: 55,0:17:09.34,0:17:11.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi lan, sökül parayı!Dialogue: 55,0:17:11.80,0:17:13.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N- N'olur yapmayın...Dialogue: 55,0:17:14.81,0:17:16.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boşuna saklanıyorsunuz!Dialogue: 55,0:17:16.89,0:17:19.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tüm kasabayı yakıp kül edeceğiz!Dialogue: 55,0:17:22.23,0:17:23.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Topla kendini!Dialogue: 55,0:17:23.73,0:17:24.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçalım!Dialogue: 55,0:17:31.70,0:17:33.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, şu kızı yakalayın!Dialogue: 55,0:17:36.16,0:17:38.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ağır ol, bakalım!Dialogue: 55,0:17:39.79,0:17:42.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne saklıyorsun?Dialogue: 55,0:17:42.58,0:17:47.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sımsıkı tuttuğun neymiş göster bakalım!Dialogue: 55,0:17:48.51,0:17:49.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu...Dialogue: 55,0:17:49.34,0:17:51.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha? Süt mü?Dialogue: 55,0:17:52.38,0:17:54.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Para sanmıştım lan.Dialogue: 55,0:17:54.05,0:17:56.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neyse, onu da alırız.Dialogue: 55,0:17:56.64,0:18:00.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olmaz, bu süt kasabanın çocukları için sağıldı.Dialogue: 55,0:18:00.43,0:18:01.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kes lan!Dialogue: 55,0:18:07.44,0:18:10.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle beş para etmez bir kavanozu mu sahipleniyorsun?Dialogue: 55,0:18:13.32,0:18:15.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geri verin lütfen.Dialogue: 55,0:18:15.07,0:18:19.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Süt bizim için çok değerli!Dialogue: 55,0:18:19.16,0:18:20.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?!Dialogue: 55,0:18:20.33,0:18:23.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paranı da sökülsene be kadın!Dialogue: 55,0:18:23.04,0:18:24.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 55,0:18:24.08,0:18:25.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiç param yok ki.Dialogue: 55,0:18:25.96,0:18:28.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kutsal haraç için ayırdığınız mangırınız vardır.Dialogue: 55,0:18:29.67,0:18:34.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K- Kutsal haracı kralımızla Kutsal Ejderlere ödememiz gerekiyor ama!Dialogue: 55,0:18:34.76,0:18:39.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her gün kemer sıkıp biriktirdiğimiz...Dialogue: 55,0:18:39.72,0:18:43.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...kutsal haracı ödeyemezsem beni öldürürler!Dialogue: 55,0:18:43.19,0:18:44.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi ya?Dialogue: 55,0:18:44.31,0:18:47.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amma zalim bir kralınız varmış!Dialogue: 55,0:18:47.06,0:18:48.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamamdır, anlaşıldı.Dialogue: 55,0:18:49.98,0:18:52.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Millet, köşe bucak arayın!Dialogue: 55,0:18:52.40,0:18:55.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kutsal haracı saklıyorlar!Dialogue: 55,0:18:56.87,0:18:58.28,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Paraları varmış!Dialogue: 55,0:18:58.28,0:18:59.49,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Tek metelik bile bırakmayın!Dialogue: 55,0:18:58.62,0:18:59.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden...?!Dialogue: 55,0:19:00.45,0:19:02.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öt bakalım! Haracı nereye zulaladın?Dialogue: 55,0:19:02.91,0:19:04.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizi rahat bırakın lütfen.Dialogue: 55,0:19:04.67,0:19:06.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zaten yoksul bir kasabayız.Dialogue: 55,0:19:06.25,0:19:08.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-N'olur biriktirdiğim haracı almayın!Dialogue: 55,0:19:08.38,0:19:09.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bırak lan!Dialogue: 55,0:19:11.46,0:19:13.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yardım...Dialogue: 55,0:19:13.26,0:19:16.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Güzel güzel versen bu kadar hırpalanmazdın!Dialogue: 55,0:19:16.72,0:19:19.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Direnen herkesin kellesini alın!Dialogue: 55,0:19:21.06,0:19:22.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yalvarıyorum!Dialogue: 55,0:19:22.52,0:19:25.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lütfen bizi rahat bırakın!Dialogue: 55,0:19:25.56,0:19:26.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kes lan!Dialogue: 55,0:19:30.32,0:19:32.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saldır, Morley...Dialogue: 55,0:19:33.94,0:19:35.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen de kimsin?Dialogue: 55,0:19:38.53,0:19:40.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Niye sallanıyoruz?Dialogue: 55,0:19:50.04,0:19:52.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yerin altında bir şey mi var lan?Dialogue: 55,0:20:00.60,0:20:01.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N'oluyor?Dialogue: 55,0:20:01.85,0:20:03.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üç uçlu devasa mızrak mı?Dialogue: 55,0:20:11.15,0:20:12.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dev Kabilesi'nden mi?Dialogue: 55,0:20:12.52,0:20:15.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir, 'ki ! Bir, 'ki!Dialogue: 55,0:20:15.94,0:20:18.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir, 'ki! Bir...Dialogue: 55,0:20:18.36,0:20:20.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'ki!!!Dialogue: 55,0:20:25.37,0:20:28.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yerin altından dev çıktı lan!Dialogue: 55,0:20:28.87,0:20:31.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hem de cins bir kılıkla!Dialogue: 55,0:20:32.17,0:20:35.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne? Neden mini etek giyiyor ki?Dialogue: 55,0:20:37.01,0:20:40.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayıp ayol! Nereye bakıyorsunuz siz?Dialogue: 55,0:20:43.76,0:20:46.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Niye öyle süzüyorsunuz?Dialogue: 55,0:20:46.77,0:20:49.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O kadar mı dibiniz düştü canlar?Dialogue: 55,0:20:49.85,0:20:52.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durduk yere sapık mı olduk şimdi?Dialogue: 55,0:20:52.11,0:20:54.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çıtkırıldım bir dayının sesiyle ne zırvalıyorsun?Dialogue: 55,0:20:54.90,0:20:57.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vurun gitsin! Kevgire çevirin!Dialogue: 55,0:20:57.65,0:20:58.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 55,0:21:00.07,0:21:02.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olmuyor ama beyler!Dialogue: 55,0:21:05.91,0:21:09.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D- Devler yerin altında yaşar mıymış?Dialogue: 55,0:21:09.92,0:21:11.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir yaşıma daha girdim.Dialogue: 55,0:21:11.42,0:21:13.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu adam da kim acaba?Dialogue: 55,0:21:13.21,0:21:16.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alınıyorum ama!Dialogue: 55,0:21:16.09,0:21:18.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lütfen ya!Dialogue: 55,0:21:18.34,0:21:21.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl olur lan?  Zemini kil parçası misali itiveriyor!Dialogue: 55,0:21:21.47,0:21:24.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gözünüz korkmasın! Bir güç kullanıcısı olsa gerek!Dialogue: 55,0:21:25.01,0:21:26.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayvan gibi güçlü!Dialogue: 55,0:21:26.64,0:21:29.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ee, ne yapmak istiyorsunuz?Dialogue: 55,0:21:30.06,0:21:31.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yumuşak başlı...Dialogue: 55,0:21:32.27,0:21:34.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...ciğeri beş para etmezler.Dialogue: 55,0:21:34.06,0:21:36.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne? Beş para etmez mi?Dialogue: 55,0:21:36.19,0:21:38.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapacağız ki?Dialogue: 55,0:21:38.57,0:21:39.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Affedersiniz!Dialogue: 55,0:21:39.53,0:21:42.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen... Kimsiniz siz?Dialogue: 55,0:21:53.12,0:21:54.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ay!Dialogue: 55,0:21:55.04,0:21:58.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İnsan bizi de bekler, Morley!Dialogue: 55,0:21:59.34,0:22:01.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne istiyorsun ya?Dialogue: 55,0:22:02.43,0:22:08.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeni icadımı denemek isterken önden gidip savaşa girdin!Dialogue: 55,0:22:08.31,0:22:10.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunlar da kimin nesi?Dialogue: 55,0:22:16.77,0:22:18.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Karga sürüsü mü?Dialogue: 55,0:22:19.23,0:22:20.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaptan!Dialogue: 55,0:22:20.24,0:22:20.86,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?!Dialogue: 55,0:22:20.86,0:22:23.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ç-Çatıda biri var!Dialogue: 55,0:22:23.66,0:22:25.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 55,0:22:25.70,0:22:27.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kargalar toplanıyor...Dialogue: 55,0:22:36.71,0:22:40.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aciz insanlara nasıl olur da saldırırsınız?Dialogue: 55,0:22:41.97,0:22:45.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaptan Pembesakal... Karşımızdaki dörtlü...Dialogue: 55,0:22:45.89,0:22:48.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...dünyanın farklı köşelerine konumlandırılmış olmaları beklenen...Dialogue: 55,0:22:49.35,0:22:50.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Devrim Ordusu'nun...Dialogue: 55,0:22:51.39,0:22:53.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Komutanları!Dialogue: 55,0:22:54.48,0:22:56.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N... N...Dialogue: 55,0:22:56.27,0:22:59.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nee?!!!Dialogue: 55,0:23:00.86,0:23:03.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hâlâ beni süzüyorlar ya.Dialogue: 55,0:23:05.36,0:23:08.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Telaş yapma tipsiz!Dialogue: 55,0:23:09.16,0:23:12.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bırakın da yeni silahımı kullanayım!Dialogue: 55,0:23:13.83,0:23:17.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık dilediğiniz gibi at koşturamayacaksınız.Dialogue: 55,0:23:18.71,0:23:20.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Devrim Ordusu'nun...Dialogue: 55,0:23:20.75,0:23:22.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...komutanları!Dialogue: 55,0:23:30.89,0:23:33.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka-oğlan'a hayranım ya!Dialogue: 55,0:23:33.56,0:23:36.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hık demiş babasının burnundan düşmüş.Dialogue: 55,0:23:37.31,0:23:38.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayrıca...Dialogue: 55,0:23:38.56,0:23:42.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Sanji-oğlan'ın Germa 66 prensi olduğunu bilmiyordum bak!Dialogue: 55,0:23:42.78,0:23:46.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İnsan söylemez mi ya?Dialogue: 55,0:23:46.20,0:23:47.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Terbiyesiz çocuk!Dialogue: 55,0:23:47.91,0:23:52.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Germa bu hadise yüzünden Dünya Hükûmeti bünyesinden çıkarıldı.Dialogue: 55,0:23:52.62,0:23:57.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka-oğlan ile Sanji-oğlan... Tam da beklediğim gibi...Dialogue: 55,0:23:57.54,0:24:01.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Büyük Korsan Çağı'nda  tüm dikkatleri üzerlerine topluyorlar!Dialogue: 55,0:24:01.92,0:24:05.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalar... Fena heyecanlandım ya!Dialogue: 55,0:24:05.97,0:24:09.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O değil de üst kademelerimiz gelemedi gitti.Dialogue: 55,0:24:09.72,0:24:12.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdiye civarda bir yere varmışlardır.Dialogue: 55,0:24:12.56,0:24:14.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyledir.Dialogue: 55,0:24:14.31,0:24:18.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu arada Sabo,  deminden beri n'apıyorsun öyle?Dialogue: 55,0:24:20.61,0:24:25.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun'un haberine bakıp bakıp sırıttığından yüzüne kramp girdi, değil mi?Dialogue: 55,0:24:25.65,0:24:27.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aptal mısın oğlum?Dialogue: 55,0:24:30.37,0:24:31.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lindbergh konuşuyor!Dialogue: 55,0:24:31.62,0:24:34.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nerede kaldınız? Herkes sizi bekliyor.Dialogue: 55,0:24:34.08,0:24:35.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen misin Sabo?Dialogue: 55,0:24:35.20,0:24:37.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Varmak üzereyiz de...Dialogue: 55,0:24:37.04,0:24:38.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...yolda bir sıkıntı çıktı!Dialogue: 55,0:24:38.87,0:24:40.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biraz geciksek sorun olur mu?Dialogue: 55,0:24:41.13,0:24:43.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dert değil, bir şeyiniz yoksa tamam.Dialogue: 55,0:24:44.96,0:24:47.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ay, eteklerim zil çalıyor!Dialogue: 55,0:24:47.13,0:24:51.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Devrim Ordusu'nun tüm üst kademeleri buraya geliyor!Dialogue: 55,0:24:51.22,0:24:53.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Morley-sama'yı görebileceğim!Dialogue: 55,0:24:53.97,0:24:56.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Betty-sama'ya vurgunum ben!Dialogue: 55,0:24:56.98,0:25:01.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabo, vakit kaybetmek istemiyoruz. Masaya şimdi oturalım.Dialogue: 55,0:25:01.23,0:25:04.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Diğerleri gelmeden planımızın üzerinden geçelim.Dialogue: 55,0:25:04.73,0:25:07.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vazife bekler, Kurmay Başkanım.Dialogue: 55,0:25:07.69,0:25:08.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tabii.Dialogue: 55,0:25:09.20,0:25:13.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaklaşan Reverie'de nihayet...Dialogue: 55,0:25:15.12,0:25:17.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kutsal Ejderlere...Dialogue: 55,0:25:18.37,0:25:20.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...savaş ilan edeceğiz.Dialogue: 55,0:25:22.29,0:25:23.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek...Dialogue: 55,0:25:24.34,0:25:25.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Devrim Ordusu'nun...Dialogue: 55,0:25:26.46,0:25:27.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...komutanıymışlar!Dialogue: 55,0:25:31.01,0:25:33.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dört üst kademenin bir kasabada ne işi var ki?Dialogue: 55,0:25:33.89,0:25:36.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of, erkekler tam bir hayvan ya!Dialogue: 55,0:25:36.51,0:25:39.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni beğendiler de ondan, patates Dev'i.Dialogue: 55,0:25:39.39,0:25:41.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ciddi olamazsın! Ay iğrendim!Dialogue: 55,0:25:41.19,0:25:45.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabo'ya da haber verdim, şimdi eğlenebilir miyiz, Betty?Dialogue: 55,0:25:45.77,0:25:47.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu saatten sonra durmam zaten.Dialogue: 55,0:25:48.57,0:25:50.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorumu ipleyen zaten yok da...Dialogue: 55,0:25:50.95,0:25:53.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...şu herif ne mırıldanıp duruyor ki?Dialogue: 55,0:25:53.74,0:25:56.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gözlerinin yaşına bakmayacağım!Dialogue: 55,0:25:56.33,0:25:58.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi de durduk yere sinirlendi!Dialogue: 55,0:25:58.83,0:26:02.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapacaksınız peki, ciğeri beş para etmezler?Dialogue: 55,0:26:02.21,0:26:03.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ölecek misiniz...Dialogue: 55,0:26:03.75,0:26:04.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...yoksa karşı mı koyacaksınız?Dialogue: 55,0:26:06.42,0:26:09.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaderinizi kendiniz çizin!Dialogue: 55,0:26:11.80,0:26:14.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahramanlığa soyunmak size düşmez mi?Dialogue: 55,0:26:18.06,0:26:20.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz de kahraman olabilirsiniz!Dialogue: 55,0:26:41.04,0:26:45.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kasaba halkı eline sopa aldı ya lan!  Kafa mı buluyorsunuz?Dialogue: 55,0:26:45.79,0:26:48.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizimle mi kapışacaksınız?Dialogue: 55,0:26:50.30,0:26:54.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden bilmiyorum ama konuşmasını dinleyince güçle dolup taşar oldum!Dialogue: 55,0:26:54.43,0:26:56.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanları püskürtelim!Dialogue: 55,0:26:57.18,0:26:59.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Savaşıp ülkemizi koruyalım!Dialogue: 55,0:27:02.35,0:27:03.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aynen öyle!Dialogue: 55,0:27:03.73,0:27:06.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Betty'nin Teşvik-Teşvik Meyvesi gücünün sonucu!Dialogue: 55,0:27:06.86,0:27:11.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sancağını sallayarak insanların içindeki gücü açığa çıkarabilir!Dialogue: 55,0:27:11.61,0:27:14.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Betty, özgürlüğün sancaktarıdır!Dialogue: 55,0:27:14.82,0:27:17.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haydi, hücum!Dialogue: 55,0:27:23.41,0:27:25.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ölmeyi bayılmak sandılar galiba!Dialogue: 55,0:27:25.67,0:27:27.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendinizi bir bok sanmayın!Dialogue: 55,0:27:29.88,0:27:32.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lind! Karasu! Halka arka çıkın!Dialogue: 55,0:27:32.63,0:27:34.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oldu bil!Dialogue: 55,0:27:34.88,0:27:35.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alın bakalım!Dialogue: 55,0:27:35.68,0:27:38.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cool Shooter!Dialogue: 55,0:27:35.68,0:27:38.22,Attack,,0,0,0,,Serin AteşleyiciDialogue: 55,0:27:38.55,0:27:39.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buz gibi!Dialogue: 55,0:27:39.80,0:27:41.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Silahım dondu!Dialogue: 55,0:27:41.60,0:27:44.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aşağılık herifler! Defolun korsanlar!Dialogue: 55,0:27:46.81,0:27:50.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geri çekilmeyin! Kılıçtan geçirin!Dialogue: 55,0:27:50.15,0:27:51.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Silahlarını alın!Dialogue: 55,0:27:57.45,0:27:59.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kargalar kılıçlarımızı götürdü!Dialogue: 55,0:27:59.57,0:28:00.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geri verin lan!Dialogue: 55,0:28:00.78,0:28:02.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durmak yok!Dialogue: 55,0:28:02.58,0:28:06.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaderinize karşı koyun!Dialogue: 55,0:28:07.08,0:28:09.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Defolun!Dialogue: 55,0:28:13.96,0:28:17.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunların içine ne girdi böyle?Dialogue: 55,0:28:17.09,0:28:19.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adi herif!Dialogue: 55,0:28:19.51,0:28:20.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sütümü...Dialogue: 55,0:28:23.39,0:28:26.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...geri ver!Dialogue: 55,0:28:45.29,0:28:46.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tüyelim!Dialogue: 55,0:28:46.45,0:28:48.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu ödeyeceksiniz!Dialogue: 55,0:28:49.71,0:28:53.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pembesakal... Ödülü alt tarafı 52 milyonmuş.Dialogue: 55,0:28:54.88,0:28:58.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Karasakal-sama bunu yanınıza bırakmaz.Dialogue: 55,0:28:58.72,0:29:02.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yazık ki emrindeki korsanlar için yerinden bile kıpırdamaz.Dialogue: 55,0:29:03.10,0:29:06.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne biçim erkeksin ya? Sus artık!Dialogue: 55,0:29:08.77,0:29:12.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kulak verin! Ey ödlek, aciz ve sersem halk!Dialogue: 55,0:29:15.02,0:29:19.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanı Dünya Hükûmeti'ne teslim ederseniz başındaki ödülü alırsınız.Dialogue: 55,0:29:20.66,0:29:24.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,52 milyon beli ödülün...Dialogue: 55,0:29:24.03,0:29:25.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...hepsi...Dialogue: 55,0:29:25.12,0:29:27.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...sizindir!Dialogue: 55,0:29:29.66,0:29:32.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir de bunu veriyorum.Dialogue: 55,0:29:33.33,0:29:36.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Devrim Ordusu'nun iletişim bilgileri.Dialogue: 55,0:29:40.09,0:29:42.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi iş çıkardınız.Dialogue: 55,0:29:42.30,0:29:43.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 55,0:29:44.64,0:29:46.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne zaman isterseniz arayın.Dialogue: 55,0:29:46.76,0:29:52.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaderine karşı koyan acizlere asla sırtımızı dönmeyiz!Dialogue: 55,0:30:03.57,0:30:06.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Belo Betty-sama!Dialogue: 55,0:30:12.37,0:30:15.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ç-Çok teşekkür ederiz, Devrim Ordusu mensupları!Dialogue: 55,0:30:24.59,0:30:28.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baksana, bu sefer ne diye toplanıyorduk?Dialogue: 55,0:30:29.02,0:30:31.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kutsal Ejderler'le savaşa gireceğiz.Dialogue: 55,0:30:31.52,0:30:35.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sevdim bu fikri! İple çekiyorum!Dialogue: 55,0:30:35.19,0:30:36.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sahi, Karasu!Dialogue: 55,0:30:37.52,0:30:39.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hoparlörünü aç.Dialogue: 55,0:30:42.95,0:30:44.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unutmuşum.Dialogue: 55,0:30:46.62,0:30:49.49,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Reverie'ye iki gün kalmıştı.Dialogue: 55,0:30:49.49,0:30:54.12,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Dünya genelindeki türlü türlü niyetler kendini göstermeye başlıyordu.Dialogue: 55,0:30:55.54,0:30:57.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam, anlaşıldı.Dialogue: 55,0:30:58.25,0:31:00.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Diğerleri aradı, Sabo-kun.Dialogue: 55,0:31:01.30,0:31:03.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Birazdan herkes gelmiş olur..Dialogue: 55,0:31:03.13,0:31:04.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ.Dialogue: 55,0:31:05.80,0:31:07.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyleyse yola koyulalım...Dialogue: 55,0:31:10.64,0:31:13.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ne biçim iş lan?Dialogue: 55,0:31:13.14,0:31:19.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,GÜLÜCÜK ticaretimin içine eden bu sersem velet...Dialogue: 55,0:31:19.52,0:31:22.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...kocakarının çöplüğünde ne geziyor?Dialogue: 55,0:31:30.24,0:31:33.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Muzaffer mi ayrılmış?Dialogue: 55,0:31:33.66,0:31:34.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?!Dialogue: 55,0:31:34.79,0:31:37.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kime, ne zaman kaybetmişim ben?!Dialogue: 55,0:31:38.25,0:31:41.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bahse varım o adi herif yazmıştır, Ana!Dialogue: 55,0:31:41.25,0:31:44.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, bunu ödeyeceksin Morgans-Dialogue: 55,0:31:44.63,0:31:45.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır...Dialogue: 55,0:31:48.59,0:31:52.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaptıklarının bedelini ödeyecek olan...Dialogue: 55,0:31:52.56,0:31:55.27,Main-207+,,0,0,2,,...Hasır Şapka'dır!Dialogue: 55,0:31:57.35,0:31:59.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İmparator mu?Dialogue: 55,0:31:59.11,0:32:01.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha yolun başındasın, evlat!Dialogue: 55,0:32:12.66,0:32:15.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yakında görüşeceğiz gibi...Dialogue: 55,0:32:17.71,0:32:18.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 55,0:32:28.05,0:32:31.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ödülün düşmüş işte, yapacak bir şey yok.Dialogue: 55,0:32:31.35,0:32:33.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sıkma canını ya Luffy!Dialogue: 55,0:32:33.60,0:32:36.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yardım ederim sana, yükseltmek için çabalarız.Dialogue: 55,0:32:36.56,0:32:39.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yemek yapayım, ister misin?Dialogue: 55,0:32:40.61,0:32:41.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olur...Dialogue: 55,0:32:45.82,0:32:46.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 55,0:32:47.53,0:32:49.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekleyin biraz.Dialogue: 55,0:32:54.70,0:32:55.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baksanıza...Dialogue: 55,0:32:56.25,0:33:00.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,100 bin, 1 milyon, 10 milyon...Dialogue: 55,0:33:00.50,0:33:02.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,100 milyo-Dialogue: 55,0:33:04.96,0:33:07.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kelle ödülün...Dialogue: 55,0:33:10.18,0:33:13.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...1,5 milyar beli olmuş!Dialogue: 55,0:33:13.97,0:33:19.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ne?!!! – Ne?!!!Dialogue: 55,0:33:20.14,0:33:25.27,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Dünya gözünü Reverie'ye dikmişken, tayfa Wano'ya doğru ilerliyor.Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.71,0:05:14.46,Author,,0,0,0,,TR: onepacetr.net | dmc3Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.50,0:15:56.50,Author,,0,0,0,,TR: onepacetr.net | dmc3Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.85,0:33:30.95,Author,,0,0,0,,TR: onepacetr.net | dmc3Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.71,0:05:14.46,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Beşinci İmparatorDialogue: 1,0:05:09.71,0:05:14.46,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Beşinci İmparatorDialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:55.66,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeni Dünya - Denizde bir yerdeDialogue: 1,0:00:52.20,0:00:55.66,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeni Dünya - Denizde bir yerdeDialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:49.54,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Kral Neptune Ryugu KrallığıDialogue: 1,0:05:45.28,0:05:49.54,Captio